      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2002-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Substituting directly, \\[(2, 4, 6) = \\dfrac{2\\cdot4\\cdot6}{2+4+6} = \\dfrac{48}{12} = 4.\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
